    {
      "id": 227,
      "type": "MarkdownNote",
      "pos": [
        1415.9539545554005,
        -84.7725910656008
      ],
      "size": [
        366.91463088408887,
        193.0746163060249
      ],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 21,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "### Info Workflow & Custom Node\n\nNodo creato dal creatore di questo workflow, per evitare un workflow troppo complesso:\n\n🔗 [Post su Reddit: My 4 Stage Upscale Workflow](https://www.reddit.com/r/StableDiffusion/comments/1paegb2/my_4_stage_upscale_workflow_to_squeeze_every_drop/)\n\n#### Installazione\nClonarlo nella cartella `custom_nodes` di **ComfyUI**:\n\n```bash\ngit clone https://github.com/peterkickasspeter-civit/ComfyUI-ZImageTurboProgressiveLockedUpscale.git"
      ],
      "color": "#222",
      "bgcolor": "#000"
    },
    {
      "id": 194,
      "type": "MarkdownNote",
      "pos": [
        -1130.653207133862,
        -350.9600757700016
      ],
      "size": [
        431.5625865566485,
        748.268194314177
      ],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 22,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "title": "Z-Image",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Model links\n\n**diffusion_models**       \n- [z_image_bf16.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/z_image/resolve/main/split_files/diffusion_models/z_image_bf16.safetensors) - [repository HF](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/z_image/tree/main/split_files/diffusion_models)\n- [z-img_fp8-e4m3fn-scaled.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/drbaph/Z-Image-fp8/resolve/main/z-img_fp8-e4m3fn-scaled.safetensors) - [repository HF](https://huggingface.co/drbaph/Z-Image-fp8/tree/main)\n\n**unet (GGUF)**\n- [z_image-QXX.gguf](https://huggingface.co/unsloth/Z-Image-GGUF/tree/main)\n\n**vae**\n- [ae.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/z_image/resolve/main/split_files/vae/ae.safetensors) - [repository HF](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/z_image/tree/main/split_files/vae)\n- [UltraFlux-v1.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Owen777/UltraFlux-v1/resolve/main/vae/diffusion_pytorch_model.safetensors) - [repository HF](https://huggingface.co/Owen777/UltraFlux-v1/tree/main/vae)\n\n**text_encoders**   \n- [qwen_3_4b.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/z_image/resolve/main/split_files/text_encoders/qwen_3_4b.safetensors) - [repository HF](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/z_image/tree/main/split_files/text_encoders)\n- [qwen_3_4b_fp4_mixed.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/z_image/resolve/main/split_files/text_encoders/qwen_3_4b_fp4_mixed.safetensors) - [repository HF](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/z_image/tree/main/split_files/text_encoders)\n- [qwen_3_4b_fp8_mixed.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/z_image/resolve/main/split_files/text_encoders/qwen_3_4b_fp8_mixed.safetensors) - [repository HF](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/z_image/tree/main/split_files/text_encoders)\n\n\n**text_encoders - GGUF**   \n- [Qwen3-4B-QXX.gguf](https://huggingface.co/unsloth/Qwen3-4B-GGUF/tree/main)\n\n**loras**\n- [Z-Image-Fun-Lora-Distill-8-Steps-2602-ComfyUI.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/alibaba-pai/Z-Image-Fun-Lora-Distill/resolve/main/Z-Image-Fun-Lora-Distill-8-Steps-2602-ComfyUI.safetensors) - [repository HF](https://huggingface.co/alibaba-pai/Z-Image-Fun-Lora-Distill/tree/main)\n\n___\n\n## FP4/FP8/BF16\n\n```\nComfyUI/\n├───📂 models/\n│   ├───📂 diffusion_models/\n│   │   ├─── z_image_bf16.safetensors\n│   │   ├─── z-img_fp8-e4m3fn-scaled.safetensors\n│   │   └─── Z-Image-Fun-Controlnet-Union-2.1.safetensors\n│   ├───📂 loras/\n│   │   └─── Z-Image-Fun-Lora-Distill-8-Steps-2602-ComfyUI.safetensors\n│   ├───📂 text_encoders/\n│   │   ├─── qwen_3_4b.safetensors \n│   │   ├─── qwen_3_4b_fp4_mixed.safetensors\n│   │   └─── qwen_3_4b_fp8_mixed.safetensors\n│   └───📂 vae/\n│       ├─── ae.safetensors\n│       └─── UltraFlux-v1.safetensors\n\n```\n___\n\n## GGUF\n\n```\nComfyUI/\n├───📂 models/\n│   ├───📂 unet/\n│   │   └─── z_image-QXX.gguf\n│   └───📂 clip/\n│       └─── Qwen_3_4b-QXX.gguf\n```\n"
      ],
      "color": "#222",
      "bgcolor": "#000"
    },
