        "## Model links\n\n**diffusion_models**       \n- [z_image_turbo_bf16.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/z_image_turbo/resolve/main/split_files/diffusion_models/z_image_turbo_bf16.safetensors) - [repository HF](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/z_image_turbo/tree/main/split_files/diffusion_models)\n- [z-image-turbo-fp8-e4m3fn.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/T5B/Z-Image-Turbo-FP8/resolve/main/z-image-turbo-fp8-e4m3fn.safetensors) - [repository HF](https://huggingface.co/T5B/Z-Image-Turbo-FP8/tree/main)\n\n**unet (GGUF)**\n- [z_image_turbo-QXX.gguf](https://huggingface.co/jayn7/Z-Image-Turbo-GGUF/tree/main)\n\n**vae**\n- [ae.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/z_image_turbo/resolve/main/split_files/vae/ae.safetensors) - [repository HF](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/z_image_turbo/tree/main/split_files/vae)\n- [UltraFlux-v1.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Owen777/UltraFlux-v1/resolve/main/vae/diffusion_pytorch_model.safetensors) - [repository HF](https://huggingface.co/Owen777/UltraFlux-v1/tree/main/vae)\n\n**text_encoders**   \n- [qwen_3_4b.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/z_image_turbo/resolve/main/split_files/text_encoders/qwen_3_4b.safetensors) - [repository HF](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/z_image_turbo/tree/main/split_files/text_encoders)\n- [qwen3_4b_fp8_scaled.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/jiangchengchengNLP/qwen3-4b-fp8-scaled/resolve/main/qwen3_4b_fp8_scaled.safetensors) - [repository HF](https://huggingface.co/jiangchengchengNLP/qwen3-4b-fp8-scaled/tree/main)\n\n**text_encoders - GGUF**   \n- [Qwen3-4B-QXX.gguf](https://huggingface.co/unsloth/Qwen3-4B-GGUF/tree/main)\n___\n\n## FP8/BF16\n\n```\nComfyUI/\n├───📂 models/\n│   ├───📂 diffusion_models/\n│   │   ├─── z_image_turbo_bf16.safetensors\n│   │   └─── z-image-turbo-fp8-e4m3fn.safetensors\n│   ├───📂 text_encoders/\n│   │   ├─── qwen_3_4b.safetensors \n│   │   └─── qwen3_4b_fp8_scaled.safetensors\n│   └───📂 vae/\n│       ├─── ae.safetensors\n│    